# =============================================================================
# GITHUB = R-ANALYSEN ONLY. Everything else stays local: no microdata, no
# generated outputs (figures/tables/PDF), no writeups/drafts/handoffs/literature.
# Only analysis/*.R, the .Rproj, README and this .gitignore are tracked.
# =============================================================================

# ignore everything by default …
/*
# … then allow only the R analysis code + minimal repo files
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/analysis/
analysis/*
!analysis/*.R
!analysis/*.Rproj

# never, under any circumstances
*.rds
*.RData
*.sav
*.dta
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.pdf
*.png
.DS_Store
.Rhistory
.Renviron
